<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Mannesmann/Krupp steel tubes deal.</title>
<headline>EU clears Mannesmann/Krupp steel tubes deal.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Tuesday it had cleared the acquisition by Mannesmann of full control of steel tubes company Mannesmann Hoescht Prazisrohr, in which it previously shared control with Krupp Hoescht Stahl.  </p>
<p>In a statement, the European Union executive said the deal would not lead to an increase in market shares.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom +32 2 287 68 11</p>
